.TH "YAMLR-FLEET" "1" "November 2026" "Yamlr Manual" "User Commands"
\fB[PRO] Fleet Intelligence & Multi-Repo GitOps PR Batching\fR
.PP
The \fByamlr fleet\fR command orchestrates manifest audits and automated remediation Pull Requests across fleets of Git repositories.
.PP
---
.PP
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.nf
.RS
yamlr fleet [status|pr-batch] [flags]
.RE
.fi
---
.PP
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
In enterprise GitOps environments, platform engineering teams manage hundreds of Kubernetes service repositories.
.PP
\fByamlr fleet\fR enables platform teams to:
.PP
1. Audit defect posture across multiple Git repositories simultaneously.
.PP
2. Apply automated schema upgrades and relational repairs across entire fleets.
.PP
3. Automatically branch, commit, push, and open Pull Requests via \fBgh\fR or \fBglab\fR CLI with audit reports attached.
.PP
---
.PP
.SH "SUBCOMMANDS"
.IP "\(bu" 2
  **\fBstatus\fR** *(default)*:
    Inspect the fleet health and defect score across configured repositories.
.PP
.IP "\(bu" 2
  **\fBpr-batch\fR**:
    Execute fleet remediation and batch-generate Pull Requests across target repositories.
.PP
---
.PP
.SH "OPTIONS & FLAGS"
.IP "\(bu" 2
  **\fB--repos <PATH>\fR**:
    Path to repository manifest file (JSON/YAML listing repos), a single repository path, or a directory containing cloned repositories.
.PP
.IP "\(bu" 2
  **\fB--branch <BRANCH>\fR**:
    Target git branch name for fleet PRs. Defaults to \fByamlr/fleet-upgrade\fR.
.PP
.IP "\(bu" 2
  **\fB--title <STRING>\fR**:
    PR title and commit message. Defaults to \fBfix(k8s): automated fleet manifest remediation\fR.
.PP
.IP "\(bu" 2
  **\fB--apply\fR**:
    Apply fixes directly to repositories on disk.
.PP
.IP "\(bu" 2
  **\fB--dry-run\fR**:
    Simulate fleet upgrades without modifying files or committing.
.PP
.IP "\(bu" 2
  **\fB--create-pr\fR**:
    Automatically push branches and open Pull Requests via GitHub CLI (\fBgh\fR) or GitLab CLI (\fBglab\fR).
.PP
.IP "\(bu" 2
  **\fB--report <FILE>\fR**:
    Path to write markdown fleet audit summary. Defaults to \fBfleet-report.md\fR.
.PP
---
.PP
.SH "EXAMPLES"
.nf
.RS
# Check status across all repositories listed in repos.yaml
yamlr fleet status --repos ./repos.yaml

# Simulate fleet upgrades across multiple repositories (dry-run)
yamlr fleet pr-batch --repos ./repos/ --dry-run

# Apply upgrades and automatically open Pull Requests on GitHub
yamlr fleet pr-batch --repos ./repos.yaml --apply --create-pr --branch "fix/k8s-1.31-upgrade"
.RE
.fi
